	Roma and Nicky Ryan.</a>

<h2>A Lasting Family Legacy</h2>

<p>Roma and Nicky had two daughters together, <strong>Ebony</strong> (born 1978) and <strong>Persia</strong> (born 1983). Enya is Persia's godmother.</p>

<p>Both daughters actively contributed artwork and layouts to the 2005 release of <em>Amarantine</em>.</p>

<p>Nicky Ryan passed away on 10 September 2025 in Dublin. The musical legacy he built alongside Roma and Enya continues to influence the global music landscape.</p>

</Layout>
